":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,51,60,61,72,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003305","helmet":"WP1021005","shield":"WP1009402"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,51,60,61,72,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003305","helmet":"WP1021005","shield":"WP1009402"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,51,60,61,72,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003305","helmet":"WP1021005","shield":"WP1009402"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,51,60,61,72,67],"title":88,"rank":"8","loyalty":"92","reputation":"12350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003305","helmet":"WP1021005","shield":"WP1009402"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10317","city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":1,"stats":[62,51,60,61,72,67],"title":88,"rank":"8","loyalty":"92","reputation":"12350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003305","helmet":"WP1021005","shield":"WP1009402"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1086402","name":{"zh":"濮阳覆灭(刘岱)","en":"Fall of Puyang (Liu Dai)"},"year":"192","month":"4","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"兖州刺史，刘繇之兄。汉室宗亲，东汉太尉刘宠之侄，早年与弟刘繇合称“二龙”。参与讨董的十八镇诸侯之一。在董卓交战后，与联合军中的桥瑁交恶，便杀害桥瑁、吞并了对方的势力。初平三年，百万青州黄巾军攻入兖州。济北相鲍信提出“固守待敌分散后逐个击破”的策略，但刘岱认为此计会导致城外百姓被劫掠，毅然选择正面迎击。最终因寡不敌众，刘岱战死沙场，兖州陷入混乱。后来奉曹操之命讨伐刘备，被张飞活捉后又释放，返回许都不久后被曹操贬为庶民的刘岱应为同名武将。","tc":"兗州刺史，劉繇之兄。漢室宗親，東漢太尉劉寵之侄，早年與弟劉繇合稱“二龍”。參與討董的十八鎮諸侯之一。在董卓交戰后，與聯合軍中的橋瑁交惡，便殺害橋瑁、吞并了對方的勢力。初平三年，百萬青州黃巾軍攻入兗州。濟北相鮑信提出“固守待敵分散后逐個擊破”的策略，但劉岱認為此計會導致城外百姓被劫掠，毅然選擇正面迎擊。最終因寡不敵眾，劉岱戰死沙場，兗州陷入混亂。后來奉曹操之命討伐劉備，被張飛活捉后又釋放，返回許都不久后被曹操貶為庶民的劉岱應為同名武將。","en":"Lt. Governor of Yan Province and elder brother of Liu Yao. A member of the Han imperial clan and nephew of Chief Officer Liu Chong of the Eastern Han, he and his younger brother were known as the ‘Two Dragons’ in their youth. He was one of the eighteen lords who joined the campaign against Dong Zhuo. After battling Dong Zhuo, he clashed with Qiao Mao of the coalition, killed him, and annexed his faction. In the 3rd year of Chuping (192), a million Yellow Turbans from Qing Province invaded Yan Province. Bao Xin, the Chancellor of Jibei, proposed the strategy of ‘holding fast until the enemy disperses to defeat them one by one,’ but Liu Dai believed this would leave civilians outside the walls to be plundered and resolutely chose to meet the enemy head-on. Vastly outnumbered, Liu Dai was killed in battle, and Yan Province fell into chaos. The Liu Dai who was later sent by Cao Cao to attack Liu Bei, captured and released by Zhang Fei, and demoted to a commoner by Cao Cao shortly after returning to Xudu, was likely an officer of the same name.","jp":"兗州刺史。劉繇の兄。漢室の宗親であり、後漢の太尉・劉寵の甥。若くして弟の劉繇とともに「二龍」と称された。董卓討伐に参加した十八諸侯の一人。董卓との交戦後、連合軍内の橋瑁と不和になり、橋瑁を殺害してその勢力を併呑した。初平三年、百万の青州黄巾軍が兗州に攻め入った。済北相の鮑信は「堅守して敵の分散を待ち、各個撃破すべし」との政策を献じたが、劉岱はこの計では城外の民が略奪に遭うと考え、正面から迎え撃つ道を選んだ。最終的に衆寡敵せず劉岱は戦死し、兗州は混乱に陥った。後に曹操の命を受けて劉備を討伐し、張飛に生け捕りにされて釈放された後、許都へ戻ってまもなく曹操により庶民に落とされた劉岱は、同姓同名の武将とされる。","kr":"연주자사이자 유요의 형이다. 한실 종친으로 동한의 태위 유총의 조카이며, 젊은 시절 아우 유요와 함께 '이룡(二龍)'이라 불렸다. 동탁 토벌에 참여한 18진 제후 중 한 사람이다. 동탁과의 교전 이후, 연합군 내에서 교모와 사이가 틀어지자 교모를 살해하고 그 세력을 집어삼켰다. 초평 3년, 백만에 달하는 청주 황건군이 연주로 쳐들어왔다. 제북상 포신이 '굳게 지키며 적이 분산되기를 기다렸다가 각개격파하자'는 책략을 제시했으나, 유대는 이 계책으로 인해 성 밖의 백성들이 약탈당할 것이라 여겨 결연히 정면 맞대응을 택했다. 그러나 결국 중과부적으로 유대는 전사하였고, 연주는 혼란에 빠졌다. 훗날 조조의 명을 받아 유비를 토벌하러 갔다가 장비에게 사로잡힌 뒤 풀려났으며, 허도로 돌아온 지 얼마 지나지 않아 조조에게 서인으로 강등당한 유대는 동명이인의 장수로 보인다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10317","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"岱","nameTc":"岱","nameEn":"Dai","nameJp":"岱","nameKr":"대","nameOther":"","word":"公山","wordTc":"公山","wordEn":"Gongshan","wordJp":"公山","wordKr":"공산","wordOther":"","icon":"刘岱","power":"WJ10317","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1022","gender":"0","rule":"62","force":"51","wise":"60","politics":"61","charm":"72","will":"67","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"50/50/50/51/50/50/50/50","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1003605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3800","battleSoulPoint":"5000","debateSoulPoint":"900","strategy":"1000501","strategy2":"1001205","professions":"2/1/1/0/0/0/1/1/2/0/1/2/1/0/1/0/0/2/0/0/0/2/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"24","loyalty":"92","reputation":"12350","evaluate":"6000","title":"88","rank":"8","birth":"147","show":"184","death":"192","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"6","weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1024405","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;7/1;8/1;11/1;12/1;14/1;28/1;30/2;25/1;21/1;16/0;18/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"WJ10173/100","mo